+/*
+ * Fixups of signed file text, each <file name>,<file offset>,<original>,<replacement> (offset in hex, byte strings in hex, at
+ * most 16 bytes): the board's table in the device tree (/chosen/text-fixups, NUL-separated entries, so it takes no command line
